{"unit_id": "tag:01J6:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为局部环（local ring）。\n上述构造给出一个双射（bijective）对应，一方为态射（morphisms）<MATH_0003>，另一方为有序对（pairs）<MATH_0004>，它由一个点（point）<MATH_0005>和一个局部同态（local homomorphism）<MATH_0006>组成，后者是局部环（local rings）之间的同态。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "bijective", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "有序对"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "local homomorphism", "target_term": "局部同态"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的目标"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "给定的环"}, {"source_term": "bijective", "target_term": "双射", "context": "描述两方对应的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "对应的一方"}, {"source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "有序对", "context": "由点和局部同态组成的另一方"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "有序对的第一项"}, {"source_term": "local homomorphism", "target_term": "局部同态", "context": "有序对的第二项"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "该局部同态的源和目标"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01J6:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为环（ring）。对任意环（ring）同态（homomorphism）<MATH_0002>，存在唯一的素理想（ideal）<MATH_0003>以及一个分解（factorization）<MATH_0004>，其中最后一个映射（map）是一个局部同态（local homomorphism），其源和目标均为局部环（local rings）。具体而言，<MATH_0005>。由引理<REF_0001>，这就证明了当<MATH_0006>为仿射概形（affine scheme）时，该引理成立。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n设<MATH_0007>为一般的概形（scheme）。任意<MATH_0008>都包含在某个开仿射（affine）子集<MATH_0009>中。由仿射（affine）情形可知，每个有序对（pair）<MATH_0010>都能作为该引理前所述构造的最终结果（product）出现。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n为完成证明，只需说明任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>的像（image）都包含于任意一个含有像（image）<MATH_0012>的仿射开集（affine open）中，这里的像是<MATH_0013>的闭点（closed point）的像。事实上，设<MATH_0014>为任一包含<MATH_0015>的开邻域（open neighbourhood）。则<MATH_0016>是包含唯一闭点（closed point）的开集（open），因而等于<MATH_0017>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "factorization", "target_term": "分解"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "local homomorphism", "target_term": "局部同态"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "有序对"}, {"source_term": "product", "target_term": "结果"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "closed point", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"source_term": "open neighbourhood", "target_term": "开邻域"}, {"source_term": "closed point", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "证明开始时给定