{"unit_id": "tag:01J5:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n作为上述引理的一个特例，对概形（scheme）中每个点（point）<MATH_0001>（所在的概形为<MATH_0002>），我们得到一个典范态射（canonical morphism）\n<MATH_0003>\n它对应于局部环（local ring）上的恒等映射（identity map），这里取的是<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>处的局部环。\n上述引理也可以表述为：对任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>，存在唯一的点（point）<MATH_0007>，使得<MATH_0008>分解为\n<MATH_0009>\n其中第一个映射（map）来自局部同态（local homomorphism）\n<MATH_0010>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n若有态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>（其源和目标均为概形（schemes）），且点（point）<MATH_0012>映到点（point）<MATH_0013>，则得到交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0014>\n其中左侧竖直映射（map）对应于局部环（local ring）映射（map）\n<MATH_0015>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "identity map", "target_term": "恒等映射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "local homomorphism", "target_term": "局部同态"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "取给定点的几何对象"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "概形中任取的点"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "由恒等映射确定的态射"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "在给定点处所取的环"}, {"source_term": "identity map", "target_term": "恒等映射", "context": "局部环上的恒等映射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "任取的待分