{"unit_id": "tag:01J7:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。\n设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>的点（points）。\n则<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>的泛化（generalization），当且仅当<MATH_0006>属于像（image），此像由典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0007>给出。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "generalization", "target_term": "泛化"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "包含所讨论诸点的对象"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "参与泛化关系的点"}, {"source_term": "generalization", "target_term": "泛化", "context": "与特殊化相对的点之间的关系"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "用来刻画泛化关系的像"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "给出该像的态射"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01J7:proof", "translation": "连续映射（map）保持特殊化（specialization）与泛化（generalization）的关系（relation）。\n由于<MATH_0001>的每个点（point）都是其闭点（closed point）的泛化（generalization），可见<MATH_0002>的像（image）中的每个点（point）都是<MATH_0003>的泛化（generalization）。\n反之，假设<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>的泛化（generalization）。取一个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0006>作为<MATH_0007>的邻域（neighbourhood）。则<MATH_0008>。设<MATH_0009>和<MATH_0010>是分别对应于<MATH_0011>和<MATH_0012>的素理想（primes）。由于<MATH_0013>是<MATH_0014>的泛化（generalization），可知<MATH_0015>。这意味着<MATH_0016>属于态射（morphism）<MATH_0017>的像（image），这正是所要证明的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "specialization", "target_term": "特殊化"}, {"source_term": "generalization", "target_term": "泛化"}, {"source_term": "relation", "target_term": "关系"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "closed point", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"source_term": "generalization", "target_term": "泛化"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "generalization", "target_term": "泛化"}, {"source_term": "generalization", "target_term": "泛化"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "primes", "target_term": "素理想"}, {"source_term": "generalization", "target_term": "泛化"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "保持该点间关系的连续映射"}, {"source_term": "specialization", "target_term": "特殊化", "context": "与泛化相对的点之间的关系"}, {"source_term": "generalization", "target_term": "泛化", "context": "与特殊化相对的点之间的关系"}, {"source_term": "relation", "target_term": "关系", "context": "连续映射所保持的关系"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "给定空间中的任一元素"}, {"source_term": "closed point", "target_term": "闭点", "context": "所给空间中被泛化的点"}, {"source_term": "generalization", "ta