{"unit_id": "tag:01J5:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n现在来讨论以域（fields）的谱（spectra）为源的态射（morphisms）。\n设<MATH_0001>为局部环（local ring），其极大理想（ideal）为<MATH_0002>，剩余域（residue field）为<MATH_0003>。\n设<MATH_0004>为域（field）。按定义，局部同态（local homomorphism）<MATH_0005>分解为<MATH_0006>，也就是说，它等同于一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>。由此可见，态射（morphisms）\n<MATH_0008>\n与有序对（pairs）<MATH_0009>相对应。我们可以在从域（fields）的谱（spectra）到<MATH_0010>的态射（morphisms）上定义一个预序（preorder）：称<MATH_0011>支配（dominates）<MATH_0012>，若<MATH_0013>经由<MATH_0014>分解。这引出如下概念：我们暂称两个态射（morphisms）<MATH_0015>和<MATH_0016>是<TEXTITOPEN_0001>等价（equivalent）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>的，若存在第三个域（field）<MATH_0017>和一个交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0018>\n当然，这立即意味着三个概形（schemes）<MATH_0019>、<MATH_0020>和<MATH_0021>各自唯一的点（points）均映射（map）到同一个<MATH_0022>。因此，由上文的说明，一个图（diagram）对应于一个点（point）<MATH_0023>以及一个由域（fields）组成的交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0024>\n这定义了一个等价关系（equivalence relation），因为给定任意一个域（field）扩张（extensions）的集合（set）<MATH_0025>，存在某个域（field）扩张（extension）<MATH_0026>，使得所有域（field）扩张（extensions）<MATH_0027>都包含在扩张（extension）<MATH_0028>中。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "fields", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "spectra", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "residue field", "target_term": "剩余域"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "local homomorphism", "target_term": "局部同态"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "有序对"}, {"source_term": "fields", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "spectra", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "preorder", "target_term": "预序"}, {"source_term": "dominates", "target_term": "支配"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "t