{"unit_id": "tag:01J5:prose-0004", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n当然，态射（morphisms）<MATH_0001>经由典范（canonical）态射（morphisms）\n<MATH_0002>分解。\n在此情形下，引理<REF_0001>的内容是：态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>分解为\n<MATH_0004>，\n只要<MATH_0005>是<MATH_0006>的泛化（generalization）。\n若有概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>，且点（point）<MATH_0008>映到点（point）<MATH_0009>，则得到一个交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0010>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "generalization", "target_term": "泛化"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "按所述方式分解的态射"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "限定分解所经由的态射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "分解所经由的典范态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "由所引引理给出分解的态射"}, {"source_term": "generalization", "target_term": "泛化", "context": "引理所给分解成立的条件"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射的源和目标"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "产生交换图的给定态射"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "给定态射源中的点"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "所给点在目标中的像"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图", "context": "由给定态射及相应的点得到的图"}], "notes": []}
